# The review policy is admitted by exact bytes: the program fingerprint hashes
# the worktree assets while verification re-admits them from the base
# revision. A CRLF checkout (Windows autocrlf) would make the two disagree,
# so the policy assets and sealed receipts always materialize with LF.
.github/codex/** text eol=lf
.github/reviews/*.receipt.json text eol=lf
